  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: StoreData
    Kind: Field
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames:
    - intervalSeconds
    - rotation
    - position
    - muscles
    - scale
    ParamDocs:
    - Time since previous frame, in seconds.
    - Root rotation.
    - Root position.
    - Humanoid muscle values (length 95 expected).
    - Avatar scale.
    Summary: "Writes one frame to disk.\n Layout (per frame, in this exact order):\n  
      float IntervalSeconds\n   Quaternion rotation (x, y, z, w)\n   Vector3 position
      (x, y, z)\n   float muscles[95]\n   float scale\n\n Total: 104 floats = 416
      bytes."
