    Summary: "Maximum number of remote players allowed to show their real avatar
      at once.\n 0 = unlimited (all in-range players show real avatars).\n Players
      beyond this limit fall back to the default avatar.\n Closest players get priority;
      currently-visible avatars are sticky to prevent pulsing."
