  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: ComputePitchCalibratedHeight
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 3
    ParamNames:
    - upY
    - downY
    - forwardY
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Computes the corrected eye height from three pitch samples (up, down,
      forward).\n The HMD traces an arc around the neck pivot when pitching. The
      midpoint of\n up/down Y values approximates the neck pivot height. The forward
      sample then\n gives the actual eye-to-pivot offset at neutral."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
