  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.UI.BasisJoinLeaveNotification
    MemberName: BasisJoinLeaveNotification
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Displays join/leave notifications below the microphone icon on the
      player's HUD.\n Uses TextMeshPro + MeshFilter/MeshRenderer with a generated
      rounded-corner quad.\n Parented under BasisLocalCameraDriver.ParentOfUI for
      VR and desktop.\n\n Fully static \u2013 driven by BasisEventDriver.LateUpdate
      via Simulate().\n Object pool pre-allocates MaxMessages slots, reuses GameObjects.\n
      Mesh cache avoids regenerating identical rounded quads."
