  - TypeFullName: BasisLocalEyeDriver
    MemberName: BasisLocalEyeDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Jobified, rig-agnostic \"natural eye look around\" with:\n - Humanoid
      LeftEye/RightEye bones\n - One-time auto-calibration per eye so it works across
      weird rigs (axis-agnostic)\n - Realistic timing: holds + fast saccades + micro-saccades\n
      - Hard clamp so eyes never exceed a max cone angle (approximated via yaw/pitch
      plane clamp)\n - Optional head micro-follow near the eye limit (prevents \"pinned
      at edge\" look)\n\n NOTE: We jobify the math/state. Transform reads/writes
      stay on main thread (LateUpdate)."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
    ObsoleteMsg: 
    Platforms: []
