  - TypeFullName: 
    MemberName: ReInitialize
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - OriginalAnimator
    ParamDocs:
    - Source animator with humanoid avatar to sample.
    Summary: "Rebuilds pose atlas by sampling Unity HumanPose muscles on a hidden
      duplicate of the provided animator.\n Captures TPose finger muscle blocks,
      bakes poses for every coordinate, and fills CoordToPose.\n Resets all per-finger
      caches to avoid stale data when swapping animators."
