    MemberName: BasisRemoteFaceDriver
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Drives automatic facial blinking using skinned mesh blendshapes.\n
      handles eye movement override aswell"
    Remarks: "This driver schedules pseudo-random blink events and animates eye-closure/opening\n
      by writing weights to a set of blink blendshapes on a SkinnedMeshRenderer.\n
