  - TypeFullName: Basis.Scripts.Networking.NetworkedAvatar.BasisBlendShapeSync
    MemberName: BasisBlendShapeSync
    Kind: Type
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Network-synced blendshape component for avatars.\n Piggybacks on player
      movement (AdditionalAvatarData, Channel 2, unreliable).\n\n Automatically filters
      out viseme/blink/laughter blendshapes \u2014 those are\n reconstructed remotely
      by uLipSync and BasisRemoteFaceManagement.\n Only face-tracking blendshapes
      are synced.\n\n Timing is driven by BasisBlendShapeDriver (Simulate/Apply pattern),\n
      NOT by MonoBehaviour Update/LateUpdate.\n\n Hooks:\n   SetWeight(filteredIndex,
      weight) \u2014 set a synced blendshape from code\n   GetWeight(filteredIndex)        
      \u2014 read current weight\n   OnWeightsReceived               \u2014 fires
      on remote side after decode\n   SyncedIndices / SyncedCount     \u2014 introspect
      what's being synced"
    Remarks: 
    Returns: 
    Value: 
    Examples: []
    TypeParamNames: []
    TypeParamDocs: []
    ExceptionCrefs: []
    ExceptionDocs: []
    SeeCrefs: []
    SeeAlsoCrefs: []
    Since: 
