  - TypeFullName: LiteNetLib.Utils.
    MemberName: GetNullableUnmanaged<T>
    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: "Reads a nullable value of type `T` from the internal byte buffer at
      the current position,\n first reading a bool indicating whether the value is
      present,\n and then reading the value itself if it exists. \n Advances the
      position by 1 byte for the presence flag plus the size of `T` if the value
      is present."
    Remarks: 
    Returns: "The nullable value of type `T` read from the buffer.\n Returns  if
      the presence flag indicates no value."
