    MemberName: Bytes
    Kind: Property
    ParamCount: 0
    ParamNames: []
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: Gets RFC4330-encoded SNTP packet.
    Remarks: "This is the only real property. All other properties except\n NtpPacket.DestinationTimestamp
      read from or write to this byte array."
    Returns: 
    Value: Byte array containing RFC4330-encoded SNTP packet. It is at least 48 bytes
      long.
    Examples: []
