    Kind: Method
    ParamCount: 1
    ParamNames:
    - 16
    ParamDocs: []
    Summary: Gets or sets the time when the server clock was last set or corrected.
    Remarks: "This Property is usually set only by servers. It usually lags server's
      current time by several minutes,\n so don't use this property for time synchronization."
    Returns: 
    Value: Time when the server clock was last set or corrected or `null` when not
      specified.
